      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f6f7f3] text-[#161b17] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" style=\"font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap\");</style>\n<main class=\"mx-auto max-w-[560px] px-6 pt-12 pb-16\" data-kid=\"1-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">\n<span class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\">SEctOr</span>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" href=\"#\">Log in</a>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.4] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">\n<li class=\"text-[#161b17]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\"><span class=\"mb-2 block h-1 rounded-full bg-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\"></span>1. Check your site</li>\n<li aria-current=\"step\" class=\"text-[#161b17] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\"><span class=\"mb-2 block h-1 rounded-full bg-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\"></span>2. See what to fix</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\"><span class=\"mb-2 block h-1 rounded-full bg-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1\"></span>3. Create account and connect</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\"><span class=\"mb-2 block h-1 rounded-full bg-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1\"></span>4. Fix and re-check</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"mt-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\">\n<h1 class=\"text-[32px] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-balance\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500\">Audit result</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\">Roshni Foundation</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\">roshnifoundation.org</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4\">Audited 27 October 2026, 10:41 am</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 max-w-[240px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\">\n<span class=\"block text-[72px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1\" style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400\">55</span>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-[2px] w-[55%] bg-[#161b17]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"audit score progress bar\"></div>\n<span class=\"mt-2 block text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3\">out of 100</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-5\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-5-1\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-5-1-1\">3 of 7</span> checks passing</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-5-2\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-5-2-1\">45</span> points in failing checks</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6\">This audit reads the page as delivered, before any JavaScript runs. Sites that build their content with JavaScript may score lower than they should.</p>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-7\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-1\">What needs attention</h2>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-2\">3 checks</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-1\">\n<p class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-1-1\">Search engines can tell who you are</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-1-2\">Needs attention</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-2\">Your site doesn't describe your organization in the standard format that search engines and AI assistants read directly.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-3\">Without it they have to guess your name, purpose and website from the page text, and may get it wrong or leave you out.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-4\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#1f4d3b] bg-[#f6f7f3] px-3 py-[2px] text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-4-1\">+20 points</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-[#f6f7f3] px-3 py-[2px] text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-4-2\">About 10 minutes, or we do it for you on WordPress</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-5\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-5-1\">Proposed change. Not applied yet.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2 rounded-[6px] border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-[#f6f7f3] p-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-5-2\" style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"NGO\",\n  \"name\": \"Roshni Foundation\",\n  \"url\": \"https://roshnifoundation.org\"\n}</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-5-3\">Added to the &lt;head&gt; of your homepage. Built from your organization name and website.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-6\">\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] border border-[#1f4d3b] bg-[#1f4d3b] px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#f6f7f3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-6-1\" href=\"#\">Create an account to fix this</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-2-7\">Technical detail: no ld+json blocks on / (homepage)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"mt-6 border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-2\">Common questions, answered</p>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-3\">+20 points</span>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-4\" href=\"#\">Open</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2-2\">A summary file for AI tools</p>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2-3\">+5 points</span>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2-4\" href=\"#\">Open</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4\">\n<summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-baseline justify-between py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-1\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-1-1\">4 checks passing</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-1-2\">Show</span>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-1\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-1-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-1-2\">Your site doesn't block AI assistants such as ChatGPT, Claude or Perplexity.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-2\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-2-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-2-2\">Your page has one main heading with section headings beneath it.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-3\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-3-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-3-2\">A clear figure appears near the top of your page.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-4\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-4-1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2-4-2\">Your page shows when it was last updated.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n</section>\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-8\">\n<a class=\"text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-8-1\" href=\"#\">Audit another website</a>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>",
