      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f6f7f3] text-[#161b17] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\" style=\"font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap\");</style>\n<main class=\"mx-auto max-w-[560px] px-6 pt-12 pb-16\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand header bar\">\n<span class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"site brand wordmark\">SEctOr</span>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"log in link\" href=\"#\">Log in</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"breadcrumb navigation row\">\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"audit result link\" href=\"#\">Audit result</a>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"finding counter label\">Finding 1 of 3</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"finding headline block\">\n<h1 class=\"text-[32px] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-balance\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"finding headline\" style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500\">Search engines can tell who you are</h1>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"finding status badge row\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"status indicator group\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"crossed lines warning icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"status label text\">Needs attention</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#1f4d3b] bg-[#fbfcf9] px-3 py-[2px] text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"points increase badge\">+20 points</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"score value text\">Score 55 of 100</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"finding summary paragraph\">Your site doesn't describe your organization in the standard format that search engines and AI assistants read directly.</p>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-5\" data-name=\"why it matters section\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"section heading false\">Why it matters</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"section description text\">Without it they have to guess your name, purpose and website from the page text, and may get it wrong or leave you out.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-6\" data-name=\"the fix section\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-1\" data-name=\"section heading false\">The fix</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"fix metadata details list\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"effort detail row\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-1-1\" data-name=\"effort label\">Effort</span>\n<span class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-1-2\" data-name=\"effort value text\">About 10 minutes, or we do it for you on WordPress</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"location detail row\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"where label\">Where</span>\n<span class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"location value text\">/ (homepage)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"wordpress action detail row\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-3-1\" data-name=\"wordpress label\">On WordPress</span>\n<span class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-3-2\" data-name=\"wordpress action value text\">SEctOr applies it, then re-checks</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-7\" data-name=\"proposed change section\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1\" data-name=\"section header row\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading false\">Proposed change</h2>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"not applied status badge\">Not applied yet</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2\" data-name=\"code placement description text\">Added to the &lt;head&gt; of your homepage. Built from your organization name and website.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-3 rounded-[6px] border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-[#fbfcf9] p-4 text-[13px] leading-[1.6] whitespace-pre-wrap [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3\" data-name=\"json schema code block\" style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace\">&lt;script type=\"application/ld+json\"&gt;\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"NGO\",\n  \"name\": \"Roshni Foundation\",\n  \"url\": \"https://roshnifoundation.org\"\n}\n&lt;/script&gt;</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4\" data-name=\"primary action button container\">\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] border border-[#1f4d3b] bg-[#1f4d3b] px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#f6f7f3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-1\" data-name=\"primary apply-fix call-to-action button\" href=\"#\">Create an account and apply this fix</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5\" data-name=\"alternative instruction paragraph\">Or paste it into your site yourself: <a class=\"text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-1\" data-name=\"view fix steps link\" href=\"#\">View fix steps</a>.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-8\" data-name=\"audit evidence section\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-8-1\" data-name=\"section heading false\">Audit evidence</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058] break-words\" data-kid=\"1-1-8-2\" data-name=\"audit evidence detail text\">Technical detail: no ld+json blocks on / (homepage)</p>\n</section>\n<nav aria-label=\"Findings\" class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-9\" data-name=\"findings footer navigation\">\n<a class=\"text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-9-1\" data-name=\"audit result link\" href=\"#\">Audit result</a>\n<a class=\"text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-9-2\" data-name=\"next finding link\" href=\"#\">Next: Common questions, answered</a>\n</nav>\n</main>\n</div>",
