      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f6f7f3] text-[#161b17] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page root container with global font\" style=\"font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap\");</style>\n<main class=\"px-4 pt-8 pb-12\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"main content column\">\n<h1 class=\"sr-only\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"visually hidden page title\" data-reason=\"h1 content is the templated audit summary used as the page headline in server-rendered snapshot\">Audit result for Roshni Foundation</h1>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"header bar with brand and login\">\n<span class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"site brand wordmark\">SEctOr</span>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"log in link\" href=\"#\">Log in</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 rounded-[12px] border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-[#fbfcf9] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"visibility score summary card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"card header row with title and date\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"check type label\">Visibility check</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"audit date text\" data-reason=\"timestamp reinitialized from audit result data\">27 Oct 2026</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"site name heading\" data-reason=\"organization name templated from audit result\">Roshni Foundation</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"site domain text\" data-reason=\"domain templated from audit result\">roshnifoundation.org</p>\n<span class=\"mt-5 block text-[72px] leading-none\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"large score number\" data-reason=\"score value reinitialized from computed audit result\" style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400\">55</span>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-[2px] w-[55%] bg-[#161b17]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"score progress bar\"></div>\n<span class=\"mt-2 block text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6\" data-name=\"score out of 100 label\">out of 100</span>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7\" data-name=\"check summary sentence\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7-1\" data-name=\"passing check count emphasis\" data-reason=\"count templated from audit result\">3 of 7</span> checks passing. <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7-2\" data-name=\"failing points count emphasis\" data-reason=\"points count templated from audit result\">45</span> points in failing checks.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8\" data-name=\"passing checks list container\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-1\" data-name=\"passing check row\">\n<span class=\"min-w-0 text-[16px] leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-1-1\" data-name=\"passing check label\">Search engines can tell who you are</span>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-1-2\" data-name=\"passing check points value\">+20</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-2\" data-name=\"passing check row\">\n<span class=\"min-w-0 text-[16px] leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-2-1\" data-name=\"passing check label\">Common questions, answered</span>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-2-2\" data-name=\"passing check points value\">+20</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-3\" data-name=\"passing check row\">\n<span class=\"min-w-0 text-[16px] leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-3-1\" data-name=\"passing check label\">A summary file for AI tools</span>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-8-3-2\" data-name=\"passing check points value\">+5</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-4 flex h-[44px] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] border border-[#1f4d3b] bg-[#1f4d3b] px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#f6f7f3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"call-to-action create account button\" href=\"#\">Create an account to fix these</a>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-5\" data-name=\"scoring disclaimer text\">Reads the page as delivered, before any JavaScript runs. Free, and nothing is saved.</p>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-6\" data-name=\"failing checks section\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-1\" data-name=\"section header row\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading\">What needs attention</h2>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-1-2\" data-name=\"section check count label\">3 checks</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"failing check detail card\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"warning cross icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"failing check content container\">\n<p class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"failing check title\">Search engines can tell who you are</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"check status label\">Needs attention</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-3\" data-name=\"failing check explanation text\">Your site doesn't describe your organization in the standard format that search engines and AI assistants read directly.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-4\" data-name=\"metadata tag row\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-[#f6f7f3] px-3 py-[2px] text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"points tag\">+20 points</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-[#f6f7f3] px-3 py-[2px] text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"time estimate tag\">About 10 minutes</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-5\" data-name=\"fix availability link line\"><a class=\"text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"fix available link\" href=\"#\">See the WordPress fix</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"mt-6 border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3\" data-name=\"other failing checks list\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-1\" data-name=\"failing check list item\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-1-1\" data-name=\"warning cross icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-1-2\" data-name=\"failing check title\">Common questions, answered</p>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-1-3\" data-name=\"failing check points value\">+20</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-2\" data-name=\"failing check list item\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-2-1\" data-name=\"warning cross icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-2-2\" data-name=\"failing check title\">A summary file for AI tools</p>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-3-2-3\" data-name=\"failing check points value\">+5</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4\" data-name=\"collapsible passing checks block\">\n<summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-baseline justify-between py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-1\" data-name=\"summary row with show toggle\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-1-1\" data-name=\"summary title with count\">4 checks passing</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-1-2\" data-name=\"show toggle label\">Show</span>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2\" data-name=\"passing checks list\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2-1\" data-name=\"passing check list item\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"passing check description\">Your site doesn't block AI assistants such as ChatGPT, Claude or Perplexity.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2-2\" data-name=\"passing check list item\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#1f4d3b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M3.5 9.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"passing check description\">Your page has one main heading with section headings beneath it.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n</section>\n<a class=\"mt-8 inline-block text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7\" data-name=\"audit another website link\" href=\"#\">Audit another website</a>\n</main>\n</div>",
