        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f6f7f3] text-[#161b17] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container (foundation app root)\" style=\"font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap\");</style>\n<header class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1040px] px-6 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"page header with brand and navigation\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-6 gap-y-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand and user identity row\">\n<a class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"product brand logo link (SEctOr)\" href=\"#\">SEctOr</a>\n<span class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"organization name label\">Roshni Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"ml-auto flex items-baseline gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"user identity and session controls group\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"logged-in user display name\">Ananya Rao</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"user role label\">Owner</span>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"log out link\" href=\"#\">Log out</a>\n</span>\n</div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main\" class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] pb-3 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"main navigation menu\">\n<a class=\"text-[#5b6058] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Overview nav link\" href=\"#\">Overview</a>\n<a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"text-[#161b17] no-underline underline decoration-[#1f4d3b] decoration-2 underline-offset-[10px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Audits nav link (current page)\" href=\"#\">Audits</a>\n<a class=\"text-[#5b6058] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Ad Grants nav link\" href=\"#\">Ad Grants</a>\n<a class=\"text-[#5b6058] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"Content nav link\" href=\"#\">Content</a>\n</nav>\n</header>\n<main class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1040px] px-6 pt-12 pb-16\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,65fr)_minmax(0,35fr)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"two-column split layout (content and audit aside)\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"primary WordPress connection panel\">\n<h1 class=\"text-[32px] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-balance\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"page headline (Connect WordPress)\" style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500\">Connect WordPress</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"connected site address line with change link\">roshnifoundation.org <a class=\"ml-2 text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"change site link\" href=\"#\">Change</a></p>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"scope description paragraph\">SEctOr applies one fix to this site: the organization details block in your homepage head. Nothing else on the site is written to.</p>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4\" data-name='explanation section \"What SEctOr will do\"'>\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name='section heading \"What SEctOr will do\"'>What SEctOr will do</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-3 max-w-[70ch] space-y-3 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"ordered steps list of what the tool will do\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"step one row\">\n<span class=\"w-4 shrink-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step number badge (1)\">1</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step one description text\">Read the site address, organization name and existing structured data.</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"step two row\">\n<span class=\"w-4 shrink-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step number badge (2)\">2</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step two description text\">Add the organization details block to the homepage head, when you apply that one fix.</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"step three row\">\n<span class=\"w-4 shrink-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step number badge (3)\">3</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step three description text\">Re-check the homepage after the change and record the new score.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5\" data-name='explanation section \"What it will not do\"'>\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5-1\" data-name='section heading \"What it will not do\"'>What it will not do</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-3 max-w-[70ch] space-y-2 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"bulleted list of exclusions\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"exclusion item: content changes\">Change page text, media, plugins or user accounts.</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"exclusion item: publishing redirects\">Publish, delete or redirect anything.</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"exclusion item: password storage\">Keep your application password in readable form, or show it again.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-5-3\" data-name=\"password management note text\">Access is one administrator-level application password. Remove it here at any time, or delete it in WordPress under Users, Profile, Application Passwords.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e2e4dc] pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6\" data-name=\"connection details and form section\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-1\" data-name=\"section heading (Connection details)\">Connection details</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[70ch] text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"plugin setup instructions text\">Install the SEctOr Companion plugin first. In WordPress, open Users, then Profile, then Application Passwords, and create one named SEctOr.</p>\n<form class=\"mt-5 max-w-[480px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3\" data-name=\"WordPress connection form\">\n<label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-1\" data-name=\"site address field group\">\n<span class=\"mb-1 block text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-1-1\" data-name=\"site address field label\">Site address</span>\n<input class=\"block h-[44px] w-full rounded-[6px] border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-transparent px-3 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-1-2\" data-name=\"site address input field\" value=\"https://roshnifoundation.org\"/>\n</label>\n<label class=\"mt-4 block\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-2\" data-name=\"WordPress username field group\">\n<span class=\"mb-1 block text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-2-1\" data-name=\"WordPress username field label\">WordPress username</span>\n<input class=\"block h-[44px] w-full rounded-[6px] border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-transparent px-3 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-2-2\" data-name=\"WordPress username input field\" placeholder=\"ananya\"/>\n</label>\n<label class=\"mt-4 block\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-3\" data-name=\"application password field group\">\n<span class=\"mb-1 block text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-3-1\" data-name=\"application password field label\">Application password</span>\n<span class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-3-2\" data-name=\"application password format hint\">20 characters, grouped in fours.</span>\n<input class=\"block h-[44px] w-full rounded-[6px] border border-[#e2e4dc] bg-transparent px-3 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-3-3\" data-name=\"application password input field\" placeholder=\"xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx\"/>\n</label>\n<label class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-3 text-[16px] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-4\" data-name=\"access consent checkbox group\">\n<input class=\"mt-[3px] h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-4-1\" data-name=\"access consent checkbox input\" style=\"accent-color:#1f4d3b\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-4-2\" data-name=\"access consent statement text\">I understand this gives SEctOr administrator-level access through this password, limited to the three actions above.</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-5\" data-name=\"form action button row\">\n<button class=\"inline-flex h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] border border-[#1f4d3b] bg-[#1f4d3b] px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#f6f7f3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-5-1\" data-name=\"Connect WordPress submit button\" type=\"button\">Connect WordPress</button>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#1f4d3b] underline underline-offset-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-5-2\" data-name=\"back-to-audit link\" href=\"#\">Back to audit</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-6-3-6\" data-name=\"post-action clarification note\">Connecting does not apply a fix. You choose the fix on the next screen.</p>\n</form>\n</section>\n</div>\n<aside class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"audit summary aside panel\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"audit panel heading (From your audit)\">From your audit</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 border-t border-[#e2e4dc]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"audit summary details list\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"audit row: website domain\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"audit row label (Website)\">Website</span>\n<span class=\"text-[16px] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"audit row value (domain)\">roshnifoundation.org</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"audit row: audit date/time\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"audit row label (Audited)\">Audited</span>\n<span class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"audit row value (date and time)\">27 Oct 2026, 10:41 am</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"audit row: finding description\">\n<span class=\"block text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"audit row label (Finding)\">Finding</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[16px] leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"audit finding value (search engines identity)\">Search engines can tell who you are</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"audit row: points value\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"audit row label (Points)\">Points</span>\n<span class=\"text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"audit row value (point count)\">20</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-[#e2e4dc] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"audit row: effort estimate\">\n<span class=\"block text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"audit row label (Effort)\">Effort</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[16px] leading-[1.4]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"audit effort value\">About 10 minutes, or we do it for you</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-6\" data-name=\"audit row: status\">\n<span class=\"text-[16px] text-[#5b6058]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"audit row label (Status)\">Status</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"status badge with icon and text\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 text-[#9c6b1f]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"warning icon (X mark)\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l9 9M13.5 4.5l-9 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"></path></svg>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"status label (Needs attention)\">Needs attention</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>",
